--
For `return {{b, e}};' the move constructor was taken as viable through a
user-defined conversion of the inner list (the variadic constructor
template made any list look convertible), and chosen: "invalid implicit
conversion to 'struct opt &&'".  libc++'s std::optional<chk> has this
shape.
